values ('d0f1a2b3-4c5d-4e80-9f90-0a1b2c3d4e50', 'research-methods-in-psychology', 'Research Methods in Psychology', 'Research Methods in Psychology covers the scientific method, research questions and literature review, experimental designs, correlational and observational designs, and internal, external, construct, and statistical validity. It also covers operationalization and measurement, sampling and participant recruitment, survey and questionnaire methods, quasi-experimental designs, qualitative methods, research ethics and IRB, replication, reproducibility, and open science, data management and basic analysis planning, and APA writing and research reporting.');

